('personality','Extraversion','Do you easily speak up and assert your opinions in group settings?',
	'[{"id":"a2","label":"No, I rarely speak up"},{"id":"b2","label":"Only if asked directly"},{"id":"c2","label":"Sometimes, depending on the topic"},{"id":"d2","label":"Yes, I am comfortable asserting my opinions."}]','d2'),
('personality','Extraversion','After spending a day alone, how do you usually feel?',
	'[{"id":"a3","label":"Drained and lonely"},{"id":"b3","label":"Neutral"},{"id":"c3","label":"Rested but fine to stay alone"},{"id":"d3","label":"Rested but quickly eager to interact with others."}]','d3'),
('personality','Extraversion','Do you often find yourself being the person who starts conversations with strangers?',
