('personality','Extraversion','Are you easily bored when things are quiet or routine?',
	'[{"id":"a11","label":"Not at all"},{"id":"b11","label":"Rarely"},{"id":"c11","label":"Sometimes"},{"id":"d11","label":"Yes, I get bored easily without stimulation."}]','d11'),
('personality','Extraversion','If there is a dispute, are you more likely to mediate or state your own view forcefully?',
