('personality','Extraversion','Is your voice expressive, or monotone?',
	'[{"id":"a22","label":"Mostly monotone"},{"id":"b22","label":"Slightly expressive"},{"id":"c22","label":"Moderately expressive"},{"id":"d22","label":"Very expressive."}]','d22'),
('personality','Extraversion','Do you prefer group projects where you can delegate tasks, or solo assignments where you control the outcome?',
